{"server":"tw","storyId":"act42side_level_act42side_09_end","groupId":"act42side","stageId":"act42side_09","title":"解經","storyCode":"MT-9","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_09_end.txt","sourceHash":"80bc3d09318ec62c5ce4b699e20ac444058ef59a14c980fa8a61dfb1c4cb12ec","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g6_pcsderivativemaze"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶——）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……暫時只能進行一些緊急處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩，毫無節制地使用光學類源石技藝，已經對你的視神經造成了無法修復的損傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有修復這種創傷的權限和能力……條件允許的話，你需要就醫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路已經在腳下顯現，雖然看不到，但也不影響我們前進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請沿著地面上的指引光走吧……這座迷宮的構造太過複雜，我的源石技藝撐不了多久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g13_pcsdoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論災異是否由此而起，門後的事物或許都能給我們答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟上，阿爾圖羅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"費德里科沒有得到回應。\n從在育嬰聖堂外追到阿爾圖羅以來，對方一直都很配合他的種種安排。\n但此刻，黑髮的薩科塔就站在幾步之外，優雅地撥弄著琴弦，並沒有跟上來的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次，我真的要越獄了，費迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩受了傷，你只有一個人，沒有比此刻更好的時機了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅，我們已經抵達真相的門口，你應該清楚此行為缺乏意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真相……意義……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……或許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費迪，你是最優秀的執行者，“行走的條律”，除了教宗以外第一位受封的聖徒……你是“送葬人”啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的“理性”、你的“冷酷”，甚至你對這兩種品質產生的懷疑，都指向律法的存續本身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果聖城本身即是如此，或許只有你能聽懂祂會說什麼，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於安多恩先生……很抱歉，雖然並非我的本意，但剛剛在你施放源石技藝的時候，我無意中觸摸了你的心聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很複雜，比我認識的許多人都複雜。但……又確實沒有多特別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太過偏執的主旋律，讓它們統統變成了同一首曲子的改編或重複循環。它們訴說著——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的起點和終點都在拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，那時你或許將孤身一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，請原諒我的冒犯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（頷首）阿爾圖羅小姐，您所謂的“冒犯”，何嘗不是我趁機進行了一次別樣的告解呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於您最後的話，我更願意視之為祝福……那說明，我真的抵達了終點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，有趣的回答。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿爾圖羅轉身過去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_i16"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但不是每個人都如此執著於拉特蘭的“真相”和“意義”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"起碼，那對我毫無吸引力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛我已經窺見了祂的一角，門後面……是一台機器，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，答案注定是無聊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想想我們在崔林特爾梅的經歷，費迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一場同等級的災異正在侵襲城市，人們在其中迷失或掙扎……此刻，拉特蘭有幾百萬值得傾聽的心聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅，你現在轉身，代表你將獨自面對迷宮裡的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"本來也需要有人幫你們把那些傢伙引開，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的守護銃已經遺失了，此時的你缺乏基本的防衛手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或許，我可以想辦法讓他們成為我的聽眾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別緊張，費迪，我也是拉特蘭欽定的危險分子啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現狀評級，高風險；存活機率，低；執行者決定……放行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"時間不等人，兩位。沒想過轉身的話，就不用為我送別了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，再見，我親愛的弟弟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g9_catastrophicalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"離群的薩科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……說了半天，你想讓我們去幫教皇廳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"理解能力滿分哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"離群的薩科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拒絕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"離群的薩科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有這個義務，莫斯提馬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"離群的薩科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你眼前的這群人裡，有一半是被教皇廳親自趕出拉特蘭的，也許是因為墮天，也許是因為礦石病……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"離群的薩科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有一半，是主動選擇了離開拉特蘭，也許是因為失望，也許是因為疑惑……無論具體的情由究竟如何。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，那你們為什麼選擇在這個時候回來呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墮天使","speakerId":"avg_npc_1806_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為光環毫無預兆地碎了啊，很難理解嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墮天使","speakerId":"avg_npc_1806_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經不屬於拉特蘭了。起碼，算是異類。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墮天使","speakerId":"avg_npc_1806_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論主動還是被迫，我們和這座城市的連繫已經中斷了，然而過了這麼多年，它的變化依然影響到了我們，沒完沒了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墮天使","speakerId":"avg_npc_1806_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*拉特蘭俚語*，這該死的光環！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來，哪怕把公證所全部的執行者都叫過來，也沒辦法處理你們的投訴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墮天使","speakerId":"avg_npc_1806_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以啊，我們回來只是為了做個了結！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過讓你們去拯救什麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墮天使","speakerId":"avg_npc_1806_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我呢，在一次執行任務的時候意外墮了天。後來成為萬國信使，更多也是因為，這樣就可以不用一直待在拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對這個國家來說，我也是個十足的異類。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒人比我更理解你們現在的心情了，朋友們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"離群的薩科塔們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許是光環的異狀催化了你們對拉特蘭的負面情緒，促使你們回到這裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們回來是因為恨、因為痛苦、因為失望……那你們更應該跟著我去阻止那支隊伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為那些讓你們恨、讓你們痛苦、讓你們失望的人，都在隊伍裡。炸藥、銃彈，隨便什麼報復手段，千萬別讓他們好過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"離群的薩科塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你只是在耍嘴皮子而已，莫斯提馬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲，被你發現了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，總得做點什麼吧——不管怎麼樣，你們已經回來了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g9_catastrophicalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，努艾達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沿著這條巷子繼續往前走，然後找個空房子躲起來。你一個人帶著這麼多小孩，不適合到處亂跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡離那支隊伍的行進方向已經有一段距離了，怪物或許不會跑到這邊來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕蒂亞，你們也要去救拉特蘭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，尋路者沒那麼高尚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但引領我們的人已經選擇走進了這場災難的最深處，我們要怎麼袖手旁觀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然他說自己所去的地方不適合太多人前往，那我們就做點力所能及的事情吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你，修女……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾達","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會保護這些孩子，無論他們來自拉特蘭還是玻利瓦爾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g8_catastrophicsquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒙恩的生物們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（急切禱告）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啟示石塔的大鐘一安靜下來，就到處都是這些傢伙吵吵鬧鬧的動靜了……好煩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你們推銷多久，我也不想要你們的光環！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒙恩的生物們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（急切禱告）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，越來越多了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"菲亞梅塔，三秒鐘，從現在的位置撤離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三秒？！喂喂，我要怎麼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g9_catastrophicalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，我動作夠快吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你還真當所有人的動作都跟你一樣快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。前面的情況很糟，連啟示石塔的鐘都不響了，伊卡萊西亞區算是徹底失守了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們要不了多久就能進入米迦萊昂區……如果那隻怪物一腳就能踩扁我們的路障，那公證所的防禦設施恐怕也沒什麼用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"攔路不是辦法，如果想不出更具破壞性的手段，我們恐怕連短短幾秒都無法拖延。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你找的救兵呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們上吧，朋友們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們肯定每個人都來過米迦萊昂區，也許是為了去銃械工坊，也許是為了去公證所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們當中很多墮天使被趕出拉特蘭之前做的最後一件事，搞不好就是被帶來這裡上繳守護銃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你們也一定見過每家銃械工坊門口的那些扛著銃的聖像……哦，公證所門口還有兩座扛著炮筒的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我們根本沒有控制這些聖像開火的權限……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就交給蕾繆安那邊解決啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友們，把這些聖像統統推倒，把它們手裡的銃都對準街道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把這幾年沒聽到的銃響，一口氣補回來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g8_catastrophicsquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“聖徒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1778_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的天，你的皮膚竟然能卡住子彈？也太厚太硬了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的，所有的銃輪流使用了一遍，還是沒辦法傷害到你嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次有這種感受，還是跟老闆玩遊戲的時候，他透過後台把難度調到最高，害我一整晚沒過關……真令人灰心啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“聖徒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1778_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灰心？不，我看到的是，哪怕光環破碎，也沒有影響你的狀態和情緒……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“聖徒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1778_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，你應該站在我的肩頭上看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“聖徒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1778_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從啟示石塔開始，到米迦萊昂區的公證所，沿途每一盞路燈都亮起來了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“聖徒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1778_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新生的同胞正在一點點地點亮這座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“聖徒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1778_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這像極了千萬年前的那次遠行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“聖徒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1778_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為一個真正的家園，我們穿越最兇險的峽谷、最貧瘠的荒原，去尋找沉睡的銀色山脈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“聖徒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1778_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯一不同的是，這一次，我們無比確定祂就在那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“聖徒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1778_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救贖是必然達成的終點，拉特蘭永遠不會墮入黑夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“聖徒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1778_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，前進，是拉特蘭此刻唯一的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“聖徒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1778_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你仍想孤身一人阻擋整支隊伍、整個種族、整座城市嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“聖徒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1778_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於聽到這令人安心的聲音了，這才是拉特蘭嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，如果我真的是孤身一人，請問這些爆炸聲是從哪裡冒出來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道並肩作戰的人是誰，但解決怪物的任務就交給他們了。而我要做的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是和你糾纏到底！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“聖徒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1778_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底什麼是災異？到底什麼是未來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底憑什麼是你決定，你們在做的事情，就是救贖，就是唯一的選擇？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g9_catastrophicalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，要去幫助她嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。於她而言，那只是一個頑劣的孩子罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰在阻止隊伍行進？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提馬和菲亞梅塔聯合了一些剛剛返回拉特蘭的人，暫時沒有發現安多恩和費德里科等人的行蹤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……小菲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再一次和自己至親的人站在了對立面……世事總是這樣無常啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕特里奇昂閣下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"專心做你自己的事情就好，薇爾麗芙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經與蒙恩的生物們建立了連繫，為牠們指明了路線。我們的共感在變得越來越強烈和清晰，越來越，不像共感……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如牧首——不，聖徒，如她所言，這本是共感應有的作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，她之前向我們呈現的都是真的。災異確實存在，而唯有依靠如此極端的方式，才能拯救拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是眼前……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟夢境已經崩毀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼前的亂象只是暫時的。往前走吧，我們已經不可能停下來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確保聖徒能夠抵達大教堂，這樣，她被迫中斷的“降生儀式”還能夠繼續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還來得及建立一個更好的拉特蘭……去解決困住我們的所有問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"未知的通訊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（滋——滋滋——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"未知的通訊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，老傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"未知的通訊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你最好停下來，我瞄準你的喉嚨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕特里奇昂","speakerId":"avg_4194_rmixer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見……奧羅拉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g7_pcsserverroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"大教堂最深處，迷宮的盡頭，最後一扇門向費德里科與安多恩敞開。\n門後，正中央的平台上，冰冷的環形機械矗立著，詭異的紅光從內部透出，逐寸掃過房間內每一個角落，伴隨著清晰可聞的嗡響……\n那是“運算”的足跡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗閣下？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"平台的正下方，老人沉默地站立著。\n他緊閉雙眼，法衣上已經積起厚厚的灰塵。費德里科和安多恩的靠近沒有引起他的任何反應，他紋絲不動，彷彿一塊不視不聽的礁石。\n唯有……\n唯有乾裂脫皮的嘴唇仍在顫動，他喃喃自語，卻發不出哪怕一個音節。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"現任教宗，伊萬杰利斯塔十一世，在神前沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明顯的失語與神經退化性症狀。初步判斷，教宗閣下的體力與神智在崩潰的邊緣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"覆蓋全城的夢境已經崩毀，為何他仍未清醒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許，他懷著與你我相同的目的來到這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，他仍未得到渴求的答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"第三十一次沙盤推演失敗。\n曾用緊急應對機制，已失效。\n檢索適格名單：\n伊萬杰利斯塔十一世……已抹除。\n費德里科·吉亞洛、安多恩·雅迦坦哲羅思……訊號穩定。\n判斷，具備協助完成轉化計劃的能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“適格”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這和你的聖徒身分有關嗎？但我為什麼也……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"適格者，位處演算模型邊緣的特殊個體。\n需作為樣本，參與沙盤推演，驗證模型完整性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教宗閣下曾數次與我談起我的聖徒身分，每次都語焉不詳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他或許也不清楚聖徒真正的職責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但若律法視我們為“適格者”，賦予我們明確的職責……那麼不論是聖徒與否，我們都應在此刻對律法負責。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沙盤推演權限，開放。\n底層數據區權限，開放。\nPCS權限開放，允許接入。\n費德里科·吉亞洛、安多恩·雅迦坦哲羅思。\nPCS將向你們同步必要前置資訊。\n現在，請上前。\n機械聲在房間內迴盪，它穩定、等速，沒有任何情感波動，甚至聽不出性別，卻又蘊含著難以言喻的威壓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最終，還是要向祂尋求答案嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或是祂向我們尋求答案，既然我們是“特殊個體”，是祂的“樣本”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現狀評級，未知；風險評級，未知；執行者決定……執行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩位薩科塔越過伊萬杰利斯塔十一世，並肩走向冰冷的機器，走向那兩個閃著光的接口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
